{"id": "1535885335643562084", "channel_id": "1326453763355185215", "author_id": "108392615644278784", "author_name": "alistiel", "content": "For side stories, most of the time, ||we replace someone who was at the event. We're not actually going to the past, we're recreating the past and \"roleplaying\" someone who was actually there. Vortice lived alone, and so far I don't think we've ever been someone who could have been an Awakener, so our viewpoint was Coalsie. Since we know things that could only be known by people who were there, and since some of the Awakeners gain some awareness of this interference event depending on how much we interfered, the Awakeners will be vaguely aware of who we replaced. Stronger Awakeners will notice immediately, but we hit Ogier with a wham line when we get back.||", "timestamp": "2026-08-09T05:39:59.387000+00:00", "reactions": [{"emoji": "thankyou", "emoji_id": "1244974830437138484", "count": 1}]}
